    <briefdescription>
<para>Type-Safe Plugin API. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides convenient template-based access to plugins. Eliminates manual void* casts.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Single<sp/>plugin</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>s3<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_plugin_a_p_i_1a8e91ab70dc88f2be8465b233a5e8467d" kindref="member">PluginAPI::get&lt;IBlobStorageBackend&gt;</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;s3_plugin&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(s3)<sp/>{<sp/>s3-&gt;write(...);<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>All<sp/>plugins<sp/>of<sp/>a<sp/>type</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>all_importers<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_plugin_a_p_i_1a8053666dc76f4a2b629e53cbf8ea0def" kindref="member">PluginAPI::getAll&lt;IImporter&gt;</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">for</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal">&amp;<sp/>importer<sp/>:<sp/>all_importers)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>importer-&gt;import_data(...);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
